Hi Everyone!

Orange moon updated to V0.1.2.0. This updates adds 8 new music tracks, story, end game cinematic, bug fixes, including one game breaking on level 3 (Thanks to 
[url=http://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049199276]Thief[/url] and [url=http://steamcommunity.com/id/oxo1978]oxo1978[/url]) and potentially others that affect camera, and more of game optimization.

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/23795648/e5adf1b84bdb3eab7001e5c5b0bf600cb5a1ed72.png[/img]

Achievements are still in development so please, submit any of those that won't unlock.

There will be another update in about 2 weeks before full release on steam.

[h1]New[/h1]
[olist]
[*] End game cinematic added, story completed;
[*] Credits added;
[*] New music track for the main menu;
[*] Added new music tracks to first, fifth, seventh and last levels;
[*] Music track for Abomination encounter;
[*] Replaced music when fighting Recycler;
[*] Improved recycler grenades effects;
[*] Reduced health of MRC Punisher M1 to 600;
[*] MRC Punisher M3 minigun bullet’s speed increased;
[*] Game optimization.
[/olist]

[h1]Bugs[/h1]
[olist]
[*] Fixed powered Loader camera going the wrong way;
[*] Fixed alien matter spawning after MRC Trooper killed;
[*] A few spelling mistakes fixed;
[*] Fixed activate tip will not remain on screen for the first ship switch on level 10 anymore;
[*] And some of tiny things.
[/olist]

Thank you for playing and your support!

