Hi everyone! 

Update 0.0.9.1 improves the controls for both controller and the mouse, adds some new stuff and removes a few bugs.
 
[h1]V0.0.9.1[/h1]
[olist]
[*] Controller - instead of digital aiming, astronaut target will now follow gamepad right stick angle; 
[*] Targeting angle increased for both mouse and controller;
[*] Added large shell box, yielding 16 shotgun ammo;
[*] New decoration - destroyed MRC bomber ships;
[*] Fixed bug when astronaut could get through the walls while using turbo jet;
[*] Astronaut won't launch grenade anymore when menu displayed;
[*] Turbo jet now consumes fuel;
[*] MRC Trooper will follow player if player decided to skip the encounter;
[*] Changed sound for machine gun dry fire;
[*] More ammo added throughout the levels.
[/olist]

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/23795648/246e13a24f17d9c06c32439d14bc7871cd13e626.png[/img]
 
[h1]Upcoming[/h1]
MRC Punisher M1, obsolete MR Corporation war machine equipped with minigun and grenades, will help astronaut shred the way through level 10, full of advanced enemies, including the final boss - MRC Punisher M3.

