Fourth level added to [b]Orange Moon[/b]. This update is a part of an upcoming version alpha 0.0.2.2 update. Fourth level contains 3 new puzzles and new Moon Piranha enemy, new scenery and visuals. New scenery and visuals added to three other levels, as well as layout improvements. Most of the known bugs were fixed.

